Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The factor in the first term creates a smooth term in time for each level of x with its own smoothing parameters. The second term creates a smooth term in time for every level of ID, but all share the same set of smoothing parameters.

